Kanban 0.4:

* Cards are connected as on the Pinboard: hover a card and drag its dot onto another card. With the Kanban template you choose the kind of connection.
* A click on an arrow selects it; its × or the Delete key removes it.

The demo site opens with a new start page, [[TiddlyVisuals]], which explains that the site offers engines for <<.graph>> and links to their demos. Flibbles' [[Graph]] page stays as it is.
